  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Add a mute button to the game volumes that would allow us, like a YouTube video for example, to switch easily between 0% and the previous value. Especially for someone like me who always uses the same exact values in my game.\nBesides not having a percentage in the QM volume for the moment, it would be perfect to have this mute button in the QM and the normal menu.\nThanks :)",
